WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps,
I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes,
I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone,
whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases.
I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel,
Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 7]

01:50.580 --> 01:52.300
[Xie Residence]
Xie Yanlai needs someone to wait on.

01:53.220 --> 01:54.260
Does it really need so many

01:54.260 --> 01:55.020
of us waiting here?

01:55.460 --> 01:56.860
Yeah. Who does he think he is?

01:57.100 --> 01:57.980
Alright, alright.

01:58.620 --> 01:59.700
It's the head's order.

02:07.860 --> 02:08.580
What's going on?

02:08.940 --> 02:10.180
What are they doing?

02:17.620 --> 02:18.500
Xie Yanlai,

02:18.540 --> 02:19.940
what do you think you're doing?

02:20.220 --> 02:21.820
Yeah. What's your problem?

02:23.980 --> 02:24.980
Who gave you the nerve

02:25.020 --> 02:26.060
to talk to me like that?

02:37.660 --> 02:38.420
Say it again.

02:39.500 --> 02:41.020
Don't think you can bully me

02:41.100 --> 02:42.060
because you're in power.

02:42.300 --> 02:43.540
Yeah.

02:43.540 --> 02:44.060
That's right.

02:44.540 --> 02:45.540
But bullying the weak

02:46.940 --> 02:48.020
is what you do best.

02:48.700 --> 02:49.740
Our clan doesn't accept

02:49.860 --> 02:51.100
a worthless lad like you.

02:51.500 --> 02:53.140
Since you're the son of a courtesan,

02:53.340 --> 02:54.980
then smile like her. Smile!

03:03.300 --> 03:04.460
He's said to be more powerful

03:04.660 --> 03:06.100
even than Young Master Yanfang.

03:06.860 --> 03:08.460
Now, he's the Imperial Guard Commander.

03:08.740 --> 03:10.100
The Grand Princess appointed him.

03:10.580 --> 03:11.500
With power,

03:11.860 --> 03:12.620
he may revenge

03:12.620 --> 03:13.660
for his childhood grievances.

03:14.380 --> 03:14.980
Young Master,

03:15.260 --> 03:16.900
by Young Master Yanfang's orders,

03:17.580 --> 03:19.260
your house has been made ready.

03:19.580 --> 03:20.420
I'll take you there.

03:21.340 --> 03:21.820
Go ahead.

03:22.260 --> 03:22.780
Yes.

03:39.220 --> 03:40.180
Father!

03:41.180 --> 03:42.220
Father!

04:05.060 --> 04:07.060
Xie Yanfang is waiting
to take advantage.

04:07.940 --> 04:09.780
Deng Yi is waiting
to profit from others' fight.

04:11.300 --> 04:12.540
Yet I have no idea

04:13.100 --> 04:13.620
about

04:13.620 --> 04:14.780
Father's physical condition.

04:16.820 --> 04:18.260
In my past life, as I recall,

04:19.020 --> 04:20.620
Father wasn't ill at this time.

04:21.660 --> 04:22.420
After my wedding,

04:22.460 --> 04:24.060
the poisoned jujube cakes

04:24.380 --> 04:25.580
worsened his health.

04:27.100 --> 04:28.860
Did I neglect anything?

04:33.420 --> 04:34.820
Your Highness, have some water.

04:44.300 --> 04:44.740
Your Highness,

04:45.100 --> 04:45.660
don't worry.

04:46.060 --> 04:47.100
Let me divine for you.

05:05.580 --> 05:06.260
It's all right.

05:07.060 --> 05:08.380
The crack points the east.

05:08.580 --> 05:09.100
It's...

05:09.580 --> 05:11.300
An omen of misfortune
turning into fortune.

05:11.700 --> 05:12.940
Misfortune turning into fortune?

05:14.980 --> 05:16.940
So, misfortune comes first.

05:20.460 --> 05:21.220
Le,

05:21.780 --> 05:23.580
go send a letter to Chu Tang.

05:24.260 --> 05:25.740
Then have someone come to see me.

05:34.700 --> 05:35.940
Thank you for coming

05:35.980 --> 05:36.820
with me tonight.

05:37.180 --> 05:37.820
You take them

05:38.060 --> 05:38.860
to buy some drinks.

05:47.380 --> 05:47.900
Mr. Xie.

05:51.340 --> 05:52.260
Her Highness summoned you.

05:54.620 --> 05:55.660
I'm going back to Yunzhong.

05:56.860 --> 05:58.220
Do you know the consequences

05:59.220 --> 06:00.580
of leaving here without permission?

06:01.500 --> 06:02.300
I do.

06:03.620 --> 06:05.420
Deng Yi and Xie Yanfang
will get suspicious.

06:06.460 --> 06:07.780
When Le traveled around,

06:08.020 --> 06:09.020
she met many Taoist physicians

06:09.500 --> 06:10.420
and got a prescription.

06:11.140 --> 06:12.340
Take it and I'll faint
from a high fever.

06:12.580 --> 06:13.620
My pulse will seem seriously weak.

06:14.300 --> 06:16.300
Then, Yu will give an order

06:16.820 --> 06:18.300
that nobody shall visit me.

06:19.780 --> 06:20.540
I won't let anyone

06:20.580 --> 06:21.780
disturb you.

06:28.140 --> 06:28.740
Le,

06:29.180 --> 06:30.260
take His Majesty to rest.

06:30.900 --> 06:31.700
Yes, Your Highness.

06:37.500 --> 06:39.020
If I feign illness and stay indoors,

06:39.460 --> 06:41.060
it'll just work out
in the ministers' favor.

06:42.100 --> 06:43.220
No one will verify

06:43.380 --> 06:44.660
if I'm truly ill.

06:45.260 --> 06:45.900
This is

06:45.940 --> 06:46.860
what they wish to see.

06:47.020 --> 06:47.700
How long can you

06:47.700 --> 06:48.820
hide this from those two?

06:49.780 --> 06:50.380
And Xiao Xun

06:50.380 --> 06:51.460
is back in his prefecture.

06:52.780 --> 06:54.300
If he gets to know about it,

06:55.180 --> 06:56.020
he won't allow you

06:56.020 --> 06:57.220
to return to the frontier.

07:01.220 --> 07:01.860
Have you

07:03.580 --> 07:04.540
thought about all this?

07:06.260 --> 07:06.980
I have.

07:09.460 --> 07:10.620
Just because Xiao Xun is away,

07:15.580 --> 07:16.420
then I can leave.

07:19.300 --> 07:20.380
Since you stay in the court,

07:21.860 --> 07:23.180
I want to make it a quick trip.

07:27.420 --> 07:28.100
Jiu,

07:29.300 --> 07:30.140
help me.

07:43.380 --> 07:45.220
In the dream I told you about,

07:50.180 --> 07:52.220
my father was covered in blood.

07:55.820 --> 07:56.700
I want to make sure

07:56.700 --> 07:58.260
if my father is doing well.

08:02.700 --> 08:04.180
I have a lot of things

08:06.660 --> 08:07.860
to say to him.

08:09.300 --> 08:10.860
I don't want to have regrets

08:12.060 --> 08:13.180
in the future.

08:15.100 --> 08:16.820
You know how it feels when regrets

08:18.100 --> 08:19.100
can never be mended.

08:20.660 --> 08:21.380
Right?

08:46.940 --> 08:47.860
I'm still worried.

08:49.420 --> 08:49.980
You know.

08:52.260 --> 08:53.260
You can't stop me.

09:14.460 --> 09:15.420
Since when have you been

09:15.460 --> 09:16.700
so indecisive?

09:17.740 --> 09:19.340
You've escorted me over 30 li.

09:20.100 --> 09:20.980
Don't tell me

09:21.700 --> 09:22.700
you hate to part with me.

09:35.940 --> 09:36.620
Rest assured.

09:37.100 --> 09:38.300
My martial arts are mediocre,

09:39.220 --> 09:40.900
but I do practice every day.

09:43.140 --> 09:44.060
Your martial skills

09:44.580 --> 09:45.580
are no match

09:46.380 --> 09:47.380
for real masters.

09:50.660 --> 09:52.020
You wretched woman!

09:52.460 --> 09:54.060
Where do you think you can run?

09:54.500 --> 09:56.140
I gave you food and drink.

09:56.380 --> 09:57.820
But you eloped with a man,

09:57.820 --> 09:58.460
didn't you?

09:58.900 --> 10:00.140
I'll break your legs!

10:07.020 --> 10:08.180
Spare my life, sir.

10:08.620 --> 10:10.340
I mistook you for someone else.

10:11.300 --> 10:12.820
Your carriage

10:13.220 --> 10:14.220
looks so much

10:14.220 --> 10:16.020
like the one I'm looking for.

10:16.220 --> 10:17.660
I didn't recognize you

10:18.260 --> 10:20.020
and then offended you.

10:20.380 --> 10:21.380
Mistook us?

10:21.700 --> 10:24.020
Who are you really after?

10:24.220 --> 10:25.380
I run a pleasure house

10:25.380 --> 10:26.340
in Wuyang Town.

10:26.700 --> 10:27.660
My top courtesan

10:27.900 --> 10:29.420
ran off with a scholar

10:29.420 --> 10:30.140
who went to the Capital.

10:30.540 --> 10:32.500
I came here to catch her.

10:32.860 --> 10:35.060
Unexpectedly, I stopped
the wrong carriage.

10:35.460 --> 10:37.020
I beg you to let me go.

10:37.060 --> 10:38.540
I don't want to die.

10:38.940 --> 10:39.580
Stop pretending.

10:40.860 --> 10:41.740
Who sent you?

10:42.380 --> 10:43.620
No one sent me.

10:43.660 --> 10:45.300
No one, really.

10:45.300 --> 10:47.060
I just got the wrong person.

10:47.260 --> 10:50.220
I don't want to die. Don't kill me.

10:53.780 --> 10:55.180
She doesn't seem to be lying.

10:56.780 --> 10:57.620
You may leave.

10:58.820 --> 11:00.500
Oh, thank you.

11:00.980 --> 11:01.860
Let's go.

11:06.980 --> 11:07.860
You're just like your father

11:07.860 --> 11:08.580
in this aspect.

11:10.060 --> 11:11.300
You're both too trusting.

11:11.940 --> 11:12.780
When I was 14,

11:12.940 --> 11:14.060
I rode alone from Yunzhong

11:14.100 --> 11:14.860
to the Capital.

11:15.180 --> 11:15.780
I can tell

11:15.820 --> 11:16.820
good people from bad.

11:18.060 --> 11:18.660
I get it.

11:19.340 --> 11:20.300
But sometimes you can't.

11:21.060 --> 11:21.700
For example...

11:22.780 --> 11:23.340
Xiao Xun.

11:27.500 --> 11:28.500
Well, you're right.

11:29.380 --> 11:30.540
So what if I misjudged him?

11:31.300 --> 11:32.660
I fixed things, anyway.

11:33.700 --> 11:34.700
And I believe

11:35.660 --> 11:36.540
you won't let me

11:36.540 --> 11:37.380
get it wrong twice.

11:50.380 --> 11:50.860
Take this.

11:51.900 --> 11:52.780
Remember what I taught you.

11:55.700 --> 11:56.540
Didn't you say

11:56.660 --> 11:57.980
my martial arts were useless?

12:00.020 --> 12:01.940
It's all right. I'm good at strategies.

12:09.500 --> 12:10.100
And this...

12:10.940 --> 12:11.820
You take it.

12:14.700 --> 12:17.100
Do you know
what the Grand Princess Token

12:18.420 --> 12:19.180
means?

12:19.580 --> 12:20.340
It means

12:22.460 --> 12:23.340
I trust you.

12:32.940 --> 12:34.180
I'll keep it for now.

12:36.380 --> 12:37.580
And guard Yu for me.

12:40.340 --> 12:41.100
You...

12:44.180 --> 12:44.940
You take care.

12:45.500 --> 12:48.540
♪My pride is torn down
and my body is sacrificed♪

12:51.580 --> 12:53.620
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

12:53.620 --> 12:55.700
♪And roars in the blaze♪

12:55.700 --> 12:58.820
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

12:59.140 --> 13:01.420
♪Fate imprisons me♪

13:01.460 --> 13:03.700
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

13:03.700 --> 13:04.700
It's dark and far.

13:05.780 --> 13:06.580
Have a safe trip.

13:06.940 --> 13:10.700
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

13:11.140 --> 13:15.620
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

13:15.700 --> 13:20.220
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

13:20.620 --> 13:23.580
♪My new pride♪

13:31.180 --> 13:33.980
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

13:33.980 --> 13:36.380
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

13:36.660 --> 13:38.420
♪Amidst the chaos♪

13:38.780 --> 13:42.980
♪I'll always be with you♪

13:44.940 --> 13:46.940
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

13:46.940 --> 13:49.020
♪And roars in the blaze♪

13:49.020 --> 13:52.140
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

13:52.780 --> 13:53.620
Do you know what

13:54.020 --> 13:54.980
the Grand Princess Token

13:56.260 --> 13:57.180
means?

13:57.540 --> 13:58.260
It means

13:59.500 --> 14:00.180
I trust you.

14:00.180 --> 14:04.020
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

14:04.100 --> 14:08.100
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

14:08.300 --> 14:13.180
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

14:14.060 --> 14:17.660
♪My new pride♪
[Xiaonan Prefecture]

14:18.620 --> 14:19.260
Your Highness,

14:19.620 --> 14:20.420
we got the news.

14:20.700 --> 14:22.060
Yesterday, the Grand Princess fell ill,

14:22.340 --> 14:23.780
had a fever and skipped court.

14:31.540 --> 14:32.380
What a coincidence.

14:33.380 --> 14:34.420
Urgent news from Yunzhong

14:35.500 --> 14:36.700
said Chu Ling was gravely ill.

14:39.340 --> 14:41.300
I never expected the two of them

14:41.980 --> 14:43.580
to be so closely connected.

14:44.380 --> 14:45.340
If she left last night,

14:45.900 --> 14:47.420
I guess she's no longer in the Capital.

14:48.700 --> 14:50.460
Since she's out of town,

14:52.060 --> 14:53.220
I'll never let her go back.

14:54.260 --> 14:56.460
She'll pass through Wuyang Town

14:56.980 --> 14:57.980
to Yunzhong.

14:58.860 --> 14:59.420
You...

15:00.020 --> 15:01.420
Have your men ambush outside town.

15:01.980 --> 15:03.780
Make sure that nothing goes wrong.

15:04.900 --> 15:06.100
I'm on it.

15:17.460 --> 15:18.180
Zhao.

15:26.340 --> 15:27.140
Stop the carriage.

15:31.500 --> 15:32.500
Where are we now?

15:32.740 --> 15:33.380
In half a day,

15:33.460 --> 15:34.340
we'll hit Wuyang Town.

15:34.500 --> 15:35.140
Wait a minute.

15:35.420 --> 15:36.260
I'll hitch the horse

15:36.300 --> 15:37.620
and tighten the reins.

15:38.900 --> 15:40.140
As far as I know about Xiao Xun,

15:40.860 --> 15:41.900
he will make a move

15:41.900 --> 15:42.820
upon receiving word

15:43.500 --> 15:44.460
of my illness.

15:45.060 --> 15:46.460
His men must be searching the town.

15:47.540 --> 15:49.260
This carriage is far too conspicuous.

15:49.500 --> 15:50.220
That's not safe.

15:52.420 --> 15:53.780
Drop me off ten li outside the town

15:54.020 --> 15:55.820
and you go northwest
along the official road.

15:56.460 --> 15:56.980
Remember.

15:57.300 --> 15:58.100
You must not stop.

15:58.780 --> 15:59.340
All right.

16:07.940 --> 16:10.700
[Wuyang Town]

16:24.660 --> 16:26.220
Just as I expected.

16:32.300 --> 16:33.220
Madam,

16:34.100 --> 16:35.780
those men don't look like good folks.

16:35.980 --> 16:36.740
What are they?

16:37.340 --> 16:38.100
Bandits?

16:39.340 --> 16:40.740
Don't say that.

16:40.820 --> 16:41.780
Our town

16:41.780 --> 16:43.180
has never been plagued by bandits.

16:43.860 --> 16:44.620
They are

16:44.660 --> 16:46.140
the guards of a squire.

16:46.140 --> 16:47.100
I've heard

16:47.140 --> 16:48.660
a maid stole valuables and ran off.

16:49.060 --> 16:50.060
Searching for a maid?

16:50.420 --> 16:51.300
Exactly.

16:51.740 --> 16:53.300
Their leader is really fierce.

16:53.780 --> 16:54.860
He even lifts up the veil

16:54.980 --> 16:55.860
of the ladies' hats.

16:58.060 --> 16:59.340
Madam, get me some tea.

17:00.100 --> 17:00.740
Coming.

17:20.420 --> 17:21.060
Mr. Deng,

17:21.220 --> 17:22.260
Her Highness is resting.

17:22.420 --> 17:23.220
She won't see anyone.

17:23.500 --> 17:25.340
Her illness involves the court.

17:25.660 --> 17:27.820
It's my duty to check on her.

17:28.220 --> 17:29.500
Don't you dare disobey me.

17:30.980 --> 17:31.620
How daring!

17:32.220 --> 17:34.300
You have no authority
over the inner palace.

17:34.940 --> 17:35.980
Take one more step forward

17:36.500 --> 17:37.220
and my sword

17:38.300 --> 17:39.500
won't show mercy.

17:45.980 --> 17:46.620
Good.

17:48.300 --> 17:49.020
Very good.

17:49.980 --> 17:50.660
Mr. Xie,

17:51.860 --> 17:53.700
let's wait and see.

18:13.420 --> 18:14.420
For her,

18:16.180 --> 18:17.540
you even offended Deng Yi.

18:20.060 --> 18:21.180
It is merely my duty.

18:22.380 --> 18:23.220
Far from offending.

18:25.500 --> 18:27.060
Tie Ying left Xiaonan

18:27.740 --> 18:29.580
and laid ambushes
all the way to Yunzhong.

18:30.940 --> 18:31.940
Do you really think

18:32.660 --> 18:33.940
she can reach the frontier alive?

18:35.260 --> 18:36.500
She's stronger

18:36.540 --> 18:37.260
than you think.

18:42.500 --> 18:43.140
Right.

18:43.700 --> 18:45.020
She's exceptionally smart.

18:46.020 --> 18:46.780
But even if she can

18:46.780 --> 18:48.340
survive Xiao Xun's ambushes,

18:49.660 --> 18:51.220
she has forgotten something.

18:53.180 --> 18:55.660
Bandits run rampant
along the way to the frontier.

18:56.700 --> 18:58.140
I'm afraid other dangers

18:59.700 --> 19:01.380
are lying ahead for her.

19:03.220 --> 19:04.380
She's a woman, after all.

19:05.060 --> 19:06.100
If she happens to run

19:06.100 --> 19:07.340
into those outlaws,

19:08.180 --> 19:09.100
how many miles

19:10.500 --> 19:12.340
do you think she can survive?

19:14.300 --> 19:14.820
Yanlai,

19:16.060 --> 19:17.980
guard the imperial city well.

19:18.700 --> 19:20.020
Otherwise, when the news

19:20.020 --> 19:20.860
of her death comes,

19:22.820 --> 19:24.900
no one will hold a funeral for her.

19:37.260 --> 19:38.620
You wretched woman!

19:38.780 --> 19:39.980
You ran away one by one.

19:40.260 --> 19:40.700
Why?

19:40.860 --> 19:41.780
Didn't I feed you

19:41.820 --> 19:42.620
or buy you nice clothes?

19:42.940 --> 19:43.540
I bought you

19:43.620 --> 19:44.900
with 20 liang of silver!

19:45.140 --> 19:45.820
If you just...

19:46.300 --> 19:47.380
Watch where you're going!

19:52.780 --> 19:53.540
We meet again.

19:58.700 --> 19:59.340
Move aside.

20:00.900 --> 20:01.580
My Lord,

20:01.620 --> 20:02.820
carriage tracks northwest.

20:02.980 --> 20:04.500
It has special horseshoe markings,

20:04.540 --> 20:05.780
like those of the Capital.

20:06.380 --> 20:07.580
Report!

20:08.260 --> 20:09.220
Behind the north dune,

20:09.220 --> 20:09.860
we found this

20:09.940 --> 20:10.660
with "Zhao" on it.

20:10.740 --> 20:12.060
I think it's from a noble lady.

20:13.260 --> 20:14.820
Report!

20:15.220 --> 20:15.860
Northeast,

20:15.860 --> 20:16.980
a woman hired a guard escort

20:17.020 --> 20:18.140
to send her to the frontier.

20:18.180 --> 20:19.300
She splurged a lot.

20:20.620 --> 20:21.620
Three traces.

20:22.700 --> 20:23.900
She left false clues, huh?

20:24.980 --> 20:25.620
Pass my order.

20:26.380 --> 20:27.140
Go three ways.

20:27.300 --> 20:28.700
Northwest, north, and northeast.

20:29.020 --> 20:29.980
Pursue all of them.

20:30.620 --> 20:31.060
My Lord,

20:31.460 --> 20:32.380
if we pursue rashly,

20:32.620 --> 20:33.220
I'm afraid...

20:33.500 --> 20:35.340
Better kill the innocent
than let them go.

20:35.780 --> 20:36.660
Every suspicious woman

20:37.340 --> 20:38.060
must be arrested.

20:38.460 --> 20:38.900
Yes.

20:47.380 --> 20:50.780
[Beicao Post House]

20:53.180 --> 20:54.060
The beef tastes good.

20:54.500 --> 20:54.980
Postmaster,

20:55.420 --> 20:56.700
the post house is small.

20:56.700 --> 20:57.980
But you offer very good service.

20:58.300 --> 20:59.260
You deliver messages

20:59.260 --> 20:59.900
to Yunzhong.

21:00.020 --> 21:01.380
The journey must be rough.

21:01.660 --> 21:02.300
This post house

21:02.420 --> 21:03.220
is just like a home.

21:03.340 --> 21:03.700
Right?

21:03.780 --> 21:04.780
You deserve nice food.

21:06.180 --> 21:07.500
Who is this girl?

21:08.140 --> 21:09.060
She isn't a local, huh?

21:09.460 --> 21:10.540
She's a poor girl.

21:11.300 --> 21:12.820
Her father worked at the frontier.

21:13.260 --> 21:13.980
She and her mother

21:14.100 --> 21:15.220
came all the way for him.

21:15.380 --> 21:16.580
Sadly, on their way,

21:16.860 --> 21:18.660
her mother fell gravely ill.

21:18.900 --> 21:19.980
Obviously, she's going

21:19.980 --> 21:20.380
to...

21:21.860 --> 21:23.860
Officers, please take me to Yunzhong.

21:24.780 --> 21:26.540
I want to see my father.

21:26.900 --> 21:27.500
But...

21:28.580 --> 21:29.340
It's urgent news.

21:29.700 --> 21:30.540
We must not delay.

21:30.860 --> 21:31.340
Officers,

21:31.460 --> 21:32.340
this girl is sensible.

21:32.580 --> 21:33.260
During the trip,

21:33.260 --> 21:34.300
she won't bring trouble.

21:34.340 --> 21:35.140
There in Yunzhong,

21:35.380 --> 21:36.660
General Chu commands strictly.

21:36.860 --> 21:37.380
When he knows

21:37.380 --> 21:38.420
you've helped someone,

21:38.620 --> 21:39.140
maybe

21:39.340 --> 21:40.620
you'll be given credit for this.

21:41.140 --> 21:41.740
What do you think?

21:44.860 --> 21:46.660
We're dispatch riders
from Wangcheng Camp.

21:47.420 --> 21:48.380
We've met General Chu

21:48.820 --> 21:50.180
a few times.

21:50.900 --> 21:51.900
Head up.

21:54.700 --> 21:56.100
There're many troops at the frontier.

21:56.980 --> 21:57.940
Tell me your name

21:58.180 --> 21:58.780
and background.

21:59.700 --> 22:00.140
She is...

22:00.140 --> 22:00.820
Let her speak.

22:05.020 --> 22:06.100
My name is Fu.

22:07.100 --> 22:08.420
My father is Yang Dachun.

22:09.820 --> 22:10.740
He serves

22:10.740 --> 22:12.540
at Saishang Outpost
in Daqing Mountain Camp,

22:13.140 --> 22:14.940
under General Chu Ling's command.

22:19.140 --> 22:20.500
This is my father's letter.

22:25.540 --> 22:27.060
His handwriting is good.

22:39.220 --> 22:40.460
Take us to see your mother.

22:40.820 --> 22:41.980
If you're telling the truth,

22:42.500 --> 22:43.740
we'll take you along.

22:44.820 --> 22:45.340
Get up.

22:45.580 --> 22:46.060
Come on.

22:47.500 --> 22:48.500
I'll take you to see her.

22:50.260 --> 22:50.740
Mother.

22:50.980 --> 22:51.500
Mother.

22:51.740 --> 22:52.380
Some officers

22:52.460 --> 22:53.540
will head for Father's camp.

22:53.660 --> 22:54.260
Mother.

22:54.420 --> 22:55.020
Mother.

22:55.340 --> 22:55.940
Mother.

22:57.340 --> 22:57.900
Mother.

23:01.060 --> 23:01.740
Mother.

23:04.260 --> 23:05.220
Have some water.

23:08.660 --> 23:09.300
Officers,

23:10.340 --> 23:12.860
are you heading
for Daqing Mountain Camp?

23:13.380 --> 23:13.900
No.

23:14.740 --> 23:15.740
But we'll pass by.

23:18.020 --> 23:20.580
What's your husband's name?

23:21.420 --> 23:22.260
How old is he?

23:23.140 --> 23:24.100
Who does he work for?

23:25.700 --> 23:26.820
You asked just now.

23:26.860 --> 23:28.100
Let her answer.

23:35.100 --> 23:35.900
My husband

23:38.300 --> 23:39.300
is Yang Dachun.

23:40.380 --> 23:41.620
The seventh day of the third month.

23:42.340 --> 23:44.180
He serves under General Chu.

23:46.780 --> 23:47.260
Mother.

23:48.100 --> 23:48.500
Mother.

23:48.900 --> 23:49.540
I...

23:51.300 --> 23:51.820
I made him

23:52.940 --> 23:54.100
a pair of new shoes.

23:55.580 --> 23:56.180
Fu,

23:57.420 --> 23:58.740
promise me you will

23:59.340 --> 24:01.700
give the shoes to your father.

24:06.980 --> 24:08.100
Let me be blunt.

24:08.980 --> 24:10.180
Our mission is urgent.

24:10.820 --> 24:12.260
The journey will be tough and swift.

24:12.660 --> 24:13.380
Young girl,

24:14.220 --> 24:16.420
keep up if you can.

24:16.740 --> 24:17.420
If you can't,

24:18.020 --> 24:19.140
we'll leave you behind.

24:19.740 --> 24:20.100
Alright.

24:20.100 --> 24:20.780
Officers,

24:21.580 --> 24:24.140
take her as far as you can.

24:25.100 --> 24:26.140
The closer

24:26.500 --> 24:27.820
she gets to her father,

24:28.300 --> 24:29.540
the sooner

24:30.020 --> 24:31.620
her father will find her.

24:32.900 --> 24:33.580
Fu,

24:34.140 --> 24:35.940
kowtow and thank them.

24:37.700 --> 24:38.780
Thank you, officers.

24:40.940 --> 24:41.380
Mother.

24:44.380 --> 24:44.820
Enough.

24:44.860 --> 24:45.460
Mother.

24:45.700 --> 24:46.580
Tomorrow morning,

24:46.660 --> 24:47.540
we'll set off.

24:49.860 --> 24:51.220
Officers!

24:52.300 --> 24:53.300
If you manage

24:53.340 --> 24:55.100
to see my husband,

24:55.580 --> 24:57.380
please tell him.

24:57.820 --> 24:58.900
I am blessed

24:58.900 --> 25:00.900
to be his wife all these years.

25:01.900 --> 25:03.500
My life is worth it.

25:04.420 --> 25:05.620
Mother.

25:08.860 --> 25:10.260
Life is so hard.

25:10.580 --> 25:11.900
So hard.

25:12.220 --> 25:13.900
My poor girl.

25:15.540 --> 25:16.060
Get packed.

25:16.580 --> 25:17.540
Our schedule is fixed.

25:17.980 --> 25:18.940
We can't stay too long.

25:20.980 --> 25:21.580
This way.

25:23.060 --> 25:25.620
Life is so cruel to us!

25:26.660 --> 25:29.380
Oh, so cruel.

25:31.540 --> 25:33.900
So cruel.

25:42.660 --> 25:43.340
Is there a girl

25:43.500 --> 25:43.980
who has

25:43.980 --> 25:45.140
my figure?

25:46.860 --> 25:47.660
Oh, I see.

25:48.580 --> 25:49.700
So you want

25:50.020 --> 25:51.660
a substitute.

25:53.820 --> 25:54.740
That's hard.

25:55.300 --> 25:56.460
Look at you.

25:56.780 --> 25:58.420
You're slender and tall.

25:58.780 --> 25:59.980
Ordinary girls

26:00.100 --> 26:01.460
wouldn't be as great as you.

26:02.660 --> 26:03.260
There are.

26:03.620 --> 26:04.620
As many as you want.

26:06.340 --> 26:07.500
Then do you have children?

26:10.580 --> 26:11.260
Just now,

26:11.820 --> 26:13.060
why did you add something extra?

26:15.380 --> 26:16.860
I'm "dying".

26:17.340 --> 26:18.380
When I missed your father

26:18.620 --> 26:19.820
and recalled our old days,

26:20.100 --> 26:21.300
that was natural,

26:21.420 --> 26:22.340
uncontrollable,

26:22.620 --> 26:23.860
and touching.

26:24.740 --> 26:25.820
You're too young.

26:26.140 --> 26:27.340
When it comes to love,

26:27.540 --> 26:29.140
I'm more experienced, after all.

26:29.340 --> 26:30.380
A frontier soldier's wife

26:30.980 --> 26:32.460
wouldn't speak such sentimental words.

26:38.100 --> 26:39.340
Fine. It's my fault. Come on.

26:40.460 --> 26:41.220
Tomorrow,

26:41.580 --> 26:43.340
will you really follow those riders?

26:44.220 --> 26:45.260
Will they see through you?

26:45.540 --> 26:46.380
Of course I will.

26:49.420 --> 26:50.900
Because I've noticed

26:51.020 --> 26:52.060
their secret.

26:52.980 --> 26:54.140
What secret?

26:57.780 --> 26:59.860
[Xie Residence]

27:15.860 --> 27:17.260
Yanlai, why do you act like a thief

27:17.940 --> 27:19.260
in your own home?

27:20.140 --> 27:21.220
I have a favor to ask.

27:23.580 --> 27:24.380
Keep it between us.

27:25.220 --> 27:26.580
How strange.

27:27.420 --> 27:28.300
I never thought

27:29.100 --> 27:30.540
you would ask for a favor.

27:34.780 --> 27:35.620
Help me leave the Capital.

27:37.780 --> 27:39.140
As the Imperial Guard Commander,

27:40.580 --> 27:41.780
you mustn't desert your post.

27:42.820 --> 27:43.420
It's the rule.

27:44.620 --> 27:45.740
You know it better than me.

27:46.620 --> 27:47.380
You're right.

27:48.980 --> 27:50.140
The trip to Yunzhong

27:50.140 --> 27:50.980
is very dangerous.

27:51.860 --> 27:52.940
She holds a unique status.

27:53.580 --> 27:54.540
If anything happens...

27:56.340 --> 27:56.980
Yanlai,

27:58.380 --> 27:59.660
I've never seen you

28:01.740 --> 28:03.220
care about someone like this.

28:10.220 --> 28:12.100
The Grand Princess affords
to feign illness.

28:12.980 --> 28:14.500
It's not easy for you

28:15.660 --> 28:17.180
to leave.

28:19.300 --> 28:20.340
Have you thought it through?

28:26.780 --> 28:27.700
If you help me,

28:30.540 --> 28:31.980
I'll owe you one.

28:42.380 --> 28:43.620
Food and water bags are ready.

28:44.220 --> 28:45.020
Take care.

28:46.140 --> 28:46.940
Thank you.

28:47.420 --> 28:48.540
And I'll trouble you

28:48.540 --> 28:49.780
to take care of my mother.

28:50.660 --> 28:51.460
Count on me.

29:05.660 --> 29:06.140
Your Majesty.

29:06.500 --> 29:06.980
Your Majesty.

29:08.420 --> 29:09.580
Stop playing.

29:09.740 --> 29:11.260
You haven't finished your lessons.

29:11.420 --> 29:12.740
If the Grand Mentor finds out...

29:14.380 --> 29:15.460
Leave me alone.

29:16.620 --> 29:17.380
If you still nag,

29:17.780 --> 29:18.540
I'll order you

29:18.780 --> 29:20.020
to catch a hundred crickets.

29:25.580 --> 29:26.740
Why aren't you studying?

29:31.020 --> 29:32.100
Uncle, you're just in time.

29:32.540 --> 29:33.140
Look.

29:33.540 --> 29:34.820
The cricket in my cage

29:35.100 --> 29:36.500
is far funnier than the Analects.

29:37.500 --> 29:38.100
Your Majesty,

29:39.740 --> 29:40.780
the Imperial Study

29:41.300 --> 29:42.420
is no place for fun.

29:46.860 --> 29:48.300
How dare you throw away my cricket!

29:50.180 --> 29:50.700
Your Majesty.

29:51.260 --> 29:52.220
Xie Yanlai, how daring!

29:52.300 --> 29:53.580
You pushed me over!

29:54.780 --> 29:55.340
Your Majesty.

29:56.420 --> 29:56.980
Mr. Xie,

29:57.100 --> 29:58.060
how could you do this?

29:59.900 --> 30:01.420
Commander Xie Yanlai

30:01.460 --> 30:02.380
misbehaved

30:02.620 --> 30:03.940
and pushed His Majesty over.

30:04.300 --> 30:05.660
This is blatant disrespect.

30:06.220 --> 30:07.500
If such behavior is allowed,

30:07.900 --> 30:09.100
all rules will be gone.

30:09.500 --> 30:11.020
You're exaggerating, Mr. Deng.

30:11.620 --> 30:12.900
My brother has been respectful.

30:13.420 --> 30:15.380
He serves His Majesty devotedly.

30:15.820 --> 30:17.180
His Majesty is young and playful.

30:17.580 --> 30:18.700
Maybe

30:19.340 --> 30:20.420
as they played around,

30:20.860 --> 30:21.900
my brother just slipped up.

30:22.300 --> 30:23.300
Are you suggesting

30:24.340 --> 30:27.100
His Majesty is slandering a minister?

30:27.540 --> 30:28.620
How dare I?

30:28.940 --> 30:30.420
The Imperial Guard Commander

30:30.460 --> 30:31.940
secures the imperial city.

30:32.340 --> 30:34.220
If he's punished
for stopping His Majesty

30:34.580 --> 30:35.580
from playing too much,

30:36.220 --> 30:38.260
the soldiers will be disheartened.

30:38.820 --> 30:40.580
You really defend your brother.

30:41.100 --> 30:43.060
The Grand Princess has been absent.

30:43.580 --> 30:45.180
The Imperial Guards are so arrogant.

30:45.900 --> 30:47.340
Mr. Xie, do you think

30:47.860 --> 30:49.380
there is no restraint

30:50.300 --> 30:52.100
for the court?

30:54.900 --> 30:56.660
Don't drag Her Highness into this.

30:57.300 --> 30:58.340
She hasn't recovered yet.

30:58.940 --> 31:00.020
His Majesty cares for her

31:00.460 --> 31:01.740
and grants her a quiet recovery.

31:02.300 --> 31:03.340
As for the restraint...

31:04.820 --> 31:06.140
You govern for His Majesty.

31:06.700 --> 31:08.260
Isn't it the greatest restraint?

31:08.740 --> 31:09.580
Enough!

31:10.820 --> 31:12.380
Xie Yanlai disrespected me!

31:12.860 --> 31:14.420
He'll be suspended for reflection!

31:15.020 --> 31:15.660
Grand Mentor!

31:16.540 --> 31:17.780
Draft the edict for me.

31:18.500 --> 31:19.540
How wise, Your Majesty.

31:20.340 --> 31:22.180
The Imperial Guards need a leader.

31:22.820 --> 31:23.580
I recommend

31:24.540 --> 31:26.140
the deputy commander to fill in.

31:26.420 --> 31:27.020
Don't bother.

31:27.620 --> 31:28.740
I'll select candidates

31:29.500 --> 31:31.540
to handle Imperial Guard affairs.

31:32.020 --> 31:33.500
His Majesty will decide.

31:33.860 --> 31:34.860
Just do it as you wish.

31:35.100 --> 31:35.780
I'm tired.

31:36.300 --> 31:37.060
Court is dismissed!

31:38.380 --> 31:40.620
- We bid farewell to Your Majesty.
- We bid farewell to Your Majesty.

32:01.220 --> 32:03.420
Fu Jiu, the Imperial Guard Commander,

32:03.420 --> 32:04.980
offended His Majesty.

32:04.980 --> 32:07.860
He got suspended from post.

32:15.220 --> 32:15.700
[One day ago]
Yanlai.

32:17.380 --> 32:17.940
His Majesty

32:17.940 --> 32:19.340
wants this letter to Her Highness.

32:20.060 --> 32:20.900
I'm quite curious.

32:21.820 --> 32:22.900
How has the Grand Princess

32:22.900 --> 32:23.900
fascinated you?

32:27.900 --> 32:28.900
Over the past five years,

32:32.580 --> 32:33.460
I never owed anyone.

32:34.140 --> 32:34.900
Do you trust me

32:34.900 --> 32:35.860
with Yu just like that?

32:37.020 --> 32:37.700
In the imperial city,

32:37.700 --> 32:39.260
many fierce forces are lurking.

32:42.340 --> 32:43.660
He can only be entrusted to you.

32:45.500 --> 32:46.460
He's of Xie Family's bloodline

32:47.540 --> 32:49.020
and your own nephew.

32:52.780 --> 32:53.940
Then give me

32:54.900 --> 32:55.940
the Grand Princess Token.

32:58.540 --> 32:59.300
If she trusts you,

33:00.860 --> 33:01.900
she must have given it.

33:05.380 --> 33:06.300
The enemy is before us.

33:08.020 --> 33:09.620
You should know what matters most.

33:10.900 --> 33:12.780
Now, the court is ruled by three forces.

33:13.500 --> 33:14.660
Deng Yi drafts edicts.

33:15.220 --> 33:16.460
I review the edicts.

33:17.060 --> 33:18.580
Without the Grand Princess's approval,

33:18.780 --> 33:19.940
no ministries shall seal them.

33:20.940 --> 33:21.860
I give you my word.

33:22.420 --> 33:23.220
I will protect Yu

33:23.220 --> 33:24.460
at any cost.

33:25.740 --> 33:27.220
I know what worries you.

33:28.660 --> 33:29.700
But don't forget.

33:30.820 --> 33:31.540
The Token can only

33:31.580 --> 33:33.540
stop Deng Yi
from issuing unauthorized edicts.

33:35.140 --> 33:36.060
It has no other use.

33:36.900 --> 33:38.020
Even if I have a plan

33:38.020 --> 33:38.580
with it,

33:38.980 --> 33:39.700
I won't succeed

33:39.700 --> 33:40.980
without Deng Yi's Imperial Seal.

33:42.700 --> 33:43.580
The token will just

33:43.900 --> 33:44.700
make it easier

33:44.700 --> 33:45.780
to counterbalance

33:45.980 --> 33:47.340
Deng Yi and me.

33:48.180 --> 33:48.780
So, Yanlai,

33:48.780 --> 33:50.180
don't doubt my intentions.

33:51.140 --> 33:52.060
Besides,

33:53.180 --> 33:54.140
with nothing to trade,

33:55.140 --> 33:56.380
how could I willingly

33:56.380 --> 33:57.620
agree to your terms?

34:37.940 --> 34:39.460
Xie Yanlai, the pawn,

34:39.580 --> 34:40.540
is out of the game,

34:40.820 --> 34:42.220
leaving the state

34:42.700 --> 34:44.420
to you and Xie Yanfang.

34:46.020 --> 34:47.140
Aren't you going

34:47.180 --> 34:48.980
to set up a scheme of loyalty

34:49.380 --> 34:51.060
when the emperor's still young?

34:52.020 --> 34:53.060
When Xiao Yu was little,

34:53.860 --> 34:55.260
he was badly frightened.

34:55.980 --> 34:56.820
Once the crowd grows,

34:57.220 --> 34:58.820
he always hides behind Chu Zhao.

35:01.940 --> 35:02.420
Wait.

35:04.820 --> 35:05.740
Chu Zhao has left.

35:06.260 --> 35:07.300
Xie Yanlai is suspended.

35:08.660 --> 35:10.380
What's in it for Xie Yanfang?

35:11.980 --> 35:13.740
In today's court,

35:14.460 --> 35:16.220
he seemed happy about that.

35:19.780 --> 35:21.220
You're really something, Xie Yanfang.

35:21.940 --> 35:23.020
Only now have I realized

35:23.740 --> 35:24.660
that you used me

35:24.700 --> 35:26.380
to complete your game.

35:26.940 --> 35:29.580
Is he plotting something

35:29.940 --> 35:31.500
against the emperor?

35:31.780 --> 35:32.500
It doesn't matter.

35:34.340 --> 35:35.620
Xie Yanfang is an uncle

35:35.620 --> 35:36.460
in name only.

35:37.660 --> 35:39.140
His Majesty is distant from him.

35:39.540 --> 35:40.900
They won't get close.

35:41.060 --> 35:42.860
What if he makes the first move

35:44.100 --> 35:45.780
to catch us off guard?

35:47.860 --> 35:48.420
Don't worry.

35:49.420 --> 35:50.660
He dare not act rashly.

35:51.980 --> 35:53.660
After all, in the court game,

35:55.220 --> 35:56.500
we like to seize the initiative

35:59.900 --> 36:01.140
and fear making a misstep.

36:01.180 --> 36:02.220
However,

36:03.220 --> 36:04.540
if Chu Ling dies,

36:05.340 --> 36:07.380
Northern Desert soldiers
will march straight here.

36:07.660 --> 36:08.460
By then,

36:09.300 --> 36:10.780
neither you nor the Xie Family

36:10.780 --> 36:12.260
can get away without losses.

36:12.860 --> 36:13.660
You're right.

36:14.900 --> 36:15.900
So, in this game,

36:16.660 --> 36:18.420
we're not sure what we'll do next.

36:19.140 --> 36:20.420
But we both know

36:22.380 --> 36:24.260
that Chu Ling must not die now.

36:34.060 --> 36:35.740
Xie Yanlai left town
at the first quarter of the Shen hour.

36:36.020 --> 36:36.620
He rode

36:36.620 --> 36:37.980
your favorite Dark Steed.

36:38.580 --> 36:39.620
Calculated by speed,

36:40.420 --> 36:42.180
he must have reached Beicao Town.

36:42.740 --> 36:43.900
He was quite obedient.

36:44.900 --> 36:46.020
He didn't even suspect

36:46.660 --> 36:48.020
the horse I gave him.

36:48.620 --> 36:49.340
How would he?

36:49.860 --> 36:50.740
You gave him

36:50.740 --> 36:51.420
your best horse.

36:51.820 --> 36:53.100
He should be grateful.

36:54.220 --> 36:56.100
Well, he was sensible this time.

36:56.620 --> 36:57.740
He did give you

36:57.740 --> 36:58.460
the Token.

37:00.420 --> 37:02.260
This token isn't of much use.

37:03.100 --> 37:04.180
But it works very well

37:05.060 --> 37:06.180
to trouble Deng Yi.

37:06.740 --> 37:07.500
But

37:08.020 --> 37:09.340
Xie Yanlai obviously has got feelings

37:09.340 --> 37:10.380
for the Grand Princess.

37:11.020 --> 37:12.380
Do you think

37:12.980 --> 37:14.340
he'll get more out of our control?

37:18.900 --> 37:20.260
The best part of taming a baby wolf

37:21.220 --> 37:22.420
is to make it think

37:22.420 --> 37:23.860
it has broken free from the collar.

37:25.060 --> 37:27.220
Actually, the collar
was replaced with gold cord.

37:28.460 --> 37:29.580
The harder he struggles,

37:30.580 --> 37:31.820
the tighter it binds him.

37:32.580 --> 37:33.660
He's risking his life

37:33.660 --> 37:34.660
to save Chu Zhao.

37:35.580 --> 37:37.060
He thinks he's resisting.

37:38.500 --> 37:39.180
Actually,

37:39.180 --> 37:41.060
he has revealed his fatal weakness.

37:42.420 --> 37:43.700
He once told me

37:45.340 --> 37:46.580
Chu Zhao was very clever.

37:48.620 --> 37:49.260
I thought

37:49.260 --> 37:50.620
he lost his judgment,

37:50.620 --> 37:51.620
driven by emotions.

37:55.140 --> 37:56.780
That woman behaves so clumsily

37:56.780 --> 37:57.700
and anxiously.

38:00.860 --> 38:02.140
What makes her smart?

38:03.620 --> 38:05.220
Now I finally understand.

38:07.140 --> 38:08.620
Making Yanlai care so much about her

38:09.900 --> 38:11.900
proves her great wisdom.

38:16.940 --> 38:18.340
How foolish of me.

38:20.420 --> 38:21.420
I fail to realize

38:22.940 --> 38:24.940
your subtle schemes.

38:34.300 --> 38:38.900
♪Broken walls and withered branches,
trapped in the mire♪

38:39.180 --> 38:41.660
♪Yet still striving
to reach for the sky♪

38:41.700 --> 38:45.740
♪My pride is torn down
and my body is sacrificed♪

38:47.980 --> 38:50.100
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

38:50.180 --> 38:52.140
♪And roars in the blaze♪

38:52.220 --> 38:55.460
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

38:55.620 --> 38:57.860
♪Fate imprisons me♪

38:58.020 --> 39:02.820
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

39:02.820 --> 39:07.020
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

39:07.020 --> 39:11.300
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

39:11.300 --> 39:16.740
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

39:16.740 --> 39:18.700
♪With no fear of the distance♪

39:18.700 --> 39:22.420
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

39:22.420 --> 39:26.860
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

39:26.860 --> 39:32.220
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

39:32.220 --> 39:35.820
♪My new pride♪

39:50.620 --> 39:53.500
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

39:53.500 --> 39:56.020
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

39:56.020 --> 39:58.380
♪Amidst the chaos♪

39:58.380 --> 40:02.660
♪I'll always be with you♪

